{"compact": {"ja_sv": "Utskottets förslag: att avslå motionsyrkandena (nuvarande ordning behålls).", "nej_sv": "Stöd för motförslaget: reservation 4 från S, V, MP.", "avstar_sv": "Partiet markerar en egen linje som inte finns med i slutomröstningens två alternativ.", "ja_en": "The committee proposal: rejecting the motions (keeping things as they are).", "nej_en": "Backing the counter-proposal: reservation 4 by S, V, MP.", "avstar_en": "The party marks a position of its own that is not one of the two final alternatives."}, "en": {"rubrik": "Control points and safe rest and parking areas", "dok_titel": "Commercial traffic and taxi", "forslag_text": "The Riksdag rejects the motions \n\n2025/26:55 by Malin Östh et al. (V) motion 16, \n\n2025/26:158 by Eric Palmqvist (SD), \n\n2025/26:920 by Hans Ekström and Caroline Helmersson Olsson (both S), \n\n2025/26:2451 by Ulrik Nilsson (M) and \n\n2025/26:3653 by Aylin Nouri et al. (S) motion 101.", "notis": "The Riksdag rejected approximately 30 proposals concerning commercial traffic and taxi in motions from the general motion period 2025. The proposals concern, among other things, matters related to supervision and control as well as the implementation of reviews within various parts of the area.\nThe Riksdag refers primarily to planned and taken measures as well as ongoing investigative and deliberative work.", "alternatives": ["The Riksdag rejects the motions \n\n2025/26:55 by Malin Östh et al. (V) motion 16, \n\n2025/26:158 by Eric Palmqvist (SD), \n\n2025/26:920 by Hans Ekström and Caroline Helmersson Olsson (both S), \n\n2025/26:2451 by Ulrik Nilsson (M) and \n\n2025/26:3653 by Aylin Nouri et al. (S) motion 101.", "Reservation 4"]}, "votering_id": "A40E1099-313D-4E00-9114-7425191C2971", "rm": "2025/26", "beteckning": "TU14", "punkt": 3, "dok_id": "HD01TU14", "datum": "2026-04-16", "utskott": "TU", "rubrik": "Kontrollplatser och säkra rast- och uppställningsplatser", "dok_titel": "Yrkestrafik och taxi", "sammanfattning": 